ok 1 - empty string
ok 2 - two characters in a row
ok 3 - two characters in a column
ok 4 - simple
ok 5 - single line
ok 6 - first line longer than second line
ok 7 - second line longer than first line
ok 8 - mixed line length
ok 9 - square
ok 10 - rectangle
ok 11 - triangle
ok 12 - jagged triangle
